# S016105 candidate summary

`src/include/uapi/linux/dpll.rs` is a fresh, path-preserving translation of
`include/uapi/linux/dpll.h`. It exposes the two family/multicast string values,
all numeric macro values, the thirteen C enum domains represented as
`core::ffi::c_int` aliases, and every selected enumerator including private and
public maximum values.

No source from an earlier Rust translation was consulted.
